flowchart TB
  accTitle: How an update of an engine reaches the repositories
  accDescr: Renovate opens a pull request for each engine, a week after the release of its new version, a minor or major one too. Its required checks, engine contracts among them, run the engine without a key; when one fails, the update doesn't merge, and no other engine waits for it. When they pass, the update merges on its own. The push to main starts the Canary, which runs the AI's whole path with the engine's action and its secret, and the release bot updates its pull request. That pull request's required check, the Canary of main, waits while a Canary of main runs. When the latest one passed, the release merges and reaches every repository that uses the action. When it failed, the release waits, the bot-health bot opens an issue, and a revert of the update or another run of the Canary lets the release go.
  renovate(["`**Renovate**: a pull request for each engine,<br>a week after its release, a major one too`"])
  checks{"`**the required checks**,<br>engine contracts among them:<br>the engine without a key`"}
  stays(["the update doesn't merge,<br>and no other engine waits for it"])
  merge["`**auto-merge** onto main`"]
  canary["`**the Canary** on main: the AI's<br>whole path with the engine's<br>action and its secret`"]
  release["`**the release bot** updates<br>its pull request`"]
  gate{"`**the Canary of main**, a required<br>check: waits while a Canary runs;<br>did the latest one pass?`"}
  ships(["the release merges and reaches<br>every repository that uses the action"])
  held(["the release waits: an issue of bot-health;<br>a revert or another run of the Canary<br>lets it go"])
  renovate --> checks
  checks -- "red" --> stays
  checks -- "green" --> merge
  merge --> canary
  merge --> release
  canary --> gate
  release --> gate
  gate -- "passed" --> ships
  gate -- "failed" --> held
  classDef trigger fill:#d4a72c33,stroke:#bf8700,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ai fill:#8250df33,stroke:#8250df,stroke-width:2px
  classDef job fill:#8c959f1f,stroke:#8c959f,stroke-width:2px
  classDef safe fill:#1a7f3726,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:2px
  classDef untrusted fill:#cf222e26,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:2px
  class renovate,checks,gate trigger
  class canary ai
  class merge,release job
  class ships safe
  class stays,held untrusted
